A post-game Elite Academy in [[Timber Town]] you can break into. 

This is where all the [[Gold Pass]] holders are holding out after the defeat of the Pillars. Only once you beat them all will they admit that their worldview needs to be reconsidered - and the gates to the Garden are opened for all to come and learn the art of battling.

